<SiteLayout title="Otter Café | Otter Homecare" description="Community, connection and a friendly cuppa with Otter Homecare.">
<header class="phero"><div class="wrap"><div class="crumb"><a href="/">Home</a> · About · Otter Café</div><h1>The Otter Café</h1><p>More than care — a warm community space where clients, families and carers come together over a cuppa, a chat and a bit of fun.</p></div></header>
<section class="section"><div class="wrap"><div class="srow reveal"><div class="srow-media"><img src="/img/cafe-festive.jpg" alt="Clients, families and the Otter Homecare team together at a festive Otter Café afternoon"></div><div><span class="eyebrow">Community</span><h2>A place to belong</h2><p class="lede">We host our Otter Café at village halls around Trowbridge — from a “spooktacular” Halloween afternoon to a sparkling Christmas get-together at Staverton Village Hall. They’re free, friendly afternoons of tea, cake, music and company.</p><p style="margin-top:14px;color:var(--muted)">Loneliness is one of the biggest challenges facing older people. The Otter Café is our way of bringing people together — clients, their families, our carers and the wider community — to share a few warm hours that brighten everyone’s week.</p></div></div></div></section>
<section class="section" style="background:var(--sky)"><div class="wrap"><div class="srow flip reveal"><div class="srow-media"><img src="/img/out-and-about.jpg" alt="An Otter Care Professional out with a client in the community"></div><div><span class="eyebrow on-clay">Where it began</span><h2>It started before we even registered</h2><p class="lede" style="margin-bottom:14px">Long before we were CQC-registered, we ran our Christmas Companionship Campaign — free two-hour festive visits to older people facing the day alone.</p><p style="color:var(--muted)">It wasn't marketing; there was nothing to sell. It's simply who we are — and it's where the Otter Café grew from. Today the café runs <strong>quarterly</strong> at village halls around Trowbridge: free afternoons of tea, cake, music and company, open to clients, families, carers and neighbours.</p></div></div></div></section>
<section class="section"><div class="wrap"><div class="head-c reveal" style="margin-bottom:22px"><span class="eyebrow">Recent afternoons</span><h2>A few moments from the café</h2></div><div class="cafe-gallery reveal"><img src="/img/cafe-gathering.jpg" alt="Clients and carers gathered around the table for tea and cake at the Otter Café"><img src="/img/cafe-staverton.jpg" alt="A member of the Otter Homecare team with a cornet at the Otter Café, Staverton Village Hall"></div></div></section>
<section class="section book"><div class="wrap" style="grid-template-columns:1fr;display:block;text-align:center"><div class="reveal" style="max-width:36ch;margin:0 auto"><span class="eyebrow" style="color:#9fc4bf">Free, no-obligation assessment</span><h2 style="margin:14px 0 12px">Let's find the right care, together</h2><p class="lede" style="margin-bottom:26px;color:#bfe0dc">Speak to a real, local person today — never a call centre.</p><div style="display:flex;gap:13px;justify-content:center;flex-wrap:wrap"><a class="btn btn-clay btn-lg" href="/#book">Book a free assessment</a><a class="btn btn-ghost btn-lg" href="tel:01225690022" style="background:transparent;color:#fff;border-color:rgba(255,255,255,.5)">Call 01225 690022</a></div></div><div class="book-trust reveal"><div class="bt-ticks"><span>Free, no-obligation home visit</span><span>A care plan built around you</span><span>We usually reply the same day</span></div><div class="bt-stars"><span class="s">★★★★★</span> Rated <b>9.4</b> by families on homecare.co.uk</div></div></div></section>
